49
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:03,350
The Core Members are dead.

50
00:05:03,150 --> 00:05:04,930
Everyone, return to the inner city !

51
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,280
The Ancestor will be able to kill him !

52
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,130
