55
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,480
Running away ?

56
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:17,970
Teng Bo
Teng Family 9th generation
Late stage Core Formation

57
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,570
How can you tolerate an intruder !?

58
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:22,440
Besides, the Ancestor is still in the city,

59
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:24,090
there is nothing to fear.

60
00:05:23,930 --> 00:05:26,260
We will act together to kill the enemy.

61
00:05:26,590 --> 00:05:28,360
All Teng Family Members,

62
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:31,150
