68
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,640
Hold on,

69
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,910
don't retreat !

70
00:06:12,230 --> 00:06:14,030
The Ancestor will definitely come !

71
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,560
Kill him !

72
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:28,390
Attack together !

73
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,790
Kill him !

74
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,750
Teng Huayuan,

75
00:06:38,910 --> 00:06:40,360
do you remember

76
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:43,870
how you slaughtered my Wang Family ?

77
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:45,480
Today

78
00:06:46,430 --> 00:06:47,760
I will

79
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:51,560
