89
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,310
Divine Sword !

90
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:36,750
Fall !

91
00:07:53,590 --> 00:07:55,240
A Soul Formation artifact ?

92
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,550
I see,

93
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,070
