98
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,670
I killed you once before.

99
00:08:31,730 --> 00:08:34,030
I can kill you again !

100
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,750
A heaven defying

101
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,750
Soul Formation artifact...

102
00:08:43,110 --> 00:08:44,830
Truly amazing.

103
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,440
But in order to control it,

104
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:52,610
