115
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:36,160
You killed my grandchild Teng Li

116
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:38,560
so I destroyed your whole family.

117
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:41,000
Your Wang Family

118
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,580
