119
00:10:42,790 --> 00:10:44,290
Nonsense !

120
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:47,140
In the cultivation world, grudges should never involve mortals.

121
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:48,960
Teng Huayuan, you violated this rule

122
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:52,790
so I will have you watch with your own eyes

123
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:56,690
the demise of the Teng Family you raised during hundreds of years !

124
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,680
First, I will kill your heart.

125
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:02,110
Then I will kill your body.

126
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,310
And finally destroy your Soul !

127
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:06,150
Ancestor, run away !

128
00:11:13,750 --> 00:11:14,840
Bo'er...

129
00:11:16,950 --> 00:11:18,750
It doesn't matter if we win or lose.

130
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:20,350
As long as the Ancestor is alive,

131
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:22,790
the Teng Family will come back to life !

132
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,710
Junior begs you,

133
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:26,470
