134
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:37,800
It's time for you to die !

135
00:11:53,110 --> 00:11:54,840
Futile resistance.

136
00:12:02,730 --> 00:12:05,750
The Divine Sword cannot kill you.

137
00:12:06,470 --> 00:12:07,800
However,

138
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,960
the stalling was not for the sword,

139
00:12:10,150 --> 00:12:12,800
but for the Reverse Formation !

140
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,560
The Teng Family cannot die

141
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:17,360
and I cannot die either !

142
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,550
Reverse formation ?

143
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:21,320
Ancestor !

144
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:24,310
Sacrifice the living.

145
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:26,720
Sacrifice the family's bloodline.

146
00:12:27,310 --> 00:12:29,910
Invoke heavenly power !

147
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:38,950
Ancestor, please...

148
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:48,550
Save me !

149
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,750
These 400 years

150
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:53,950
have been a huge gamble.

151
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:55,750
If I lose today

152
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:57,040
the Teng Family

153
00:12:57,310 --> 00:12:59,560
will be destroyed forever !

154
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:17,430
He's crazy...

155
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,030
He's crazy !

156
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,000
Daddy !

157
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,760
Daddy !

158
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:30,390
Dad...

159
00:13:31,550 --> 00:13:33,180
Nooo !

160
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,120
Bo'er,

161
00:13:42,070 --> 00:13:43,760
don't blame me.

162
00:13:44,510 --> 00:13:45,760
The Teng Family

163
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:48,390
will not lose !

164
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:06,950
I gathered everyone's cultivation in the city,

165
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,720
to destroy you, Wang Lin !

166
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,990
I will refine you for a thousand years

167
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:16,310
and have you pay for your crimes a hundredfold !

168
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,980
I think your lightning artifact is specialized

169
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:26,750
in destroying Divine Sense of the same level.

170
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:28,190
But today,

171
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:32,050
I have merged the cultivation of my whole family to the level of...

172
00:14:31,810 --> 00:14:33,590
Soul Formation !

173
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:35,370
Without your lightning,

174
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:37,470
you are worthless.

175
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:39,760
You're pathetic.

176
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:43,370
If I can kill you,

177
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:46,040
then I will restore the Teng Family

178
00:14:45,910 --> 00:14:48,160
to its golden age !

179
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,750
Get lost !

180
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,550
Die !

181
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:33,730
Futile resistance.

182
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:35,710
How long will you last ?

183
00:15:42,790 --> 00:15:45,040
Accept your death !

184
00:15:51,590 --> 00:15:52,630
Enough !

185
00:15:57,940 --> 00:15:59,160
Is this...

186
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:04,050
poison ?

187
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,750
Remnants of the poison of a Soul Formation cultivator.

188
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:11,930
Although it will not kill a Nascent Soul cultivator,

189
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:15,160
it's enough to deal with the souls of low-level cultivators.

190
00:16:15,390 --> 00:16:16,440
Destroy !

191
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,800
Wang Lin,

192
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,750
I will kill you !

193
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:27,150
It's time to end this !

194
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:43,040
Teng Huayuan,

195
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,560
die !

196
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,480
Wang Lin,

197
00:16:46,710 --> 00:16:47,770
stop !

198
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:04,530
I've had my share of wounds,

199
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:04,530
now I want to fight back.

200
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:08,090
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

201
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:14,010
that's blocking all my hopes

202
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:14,010
for life ?

203
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:19,770
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

204
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:19,770
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

205
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:23,170
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

206
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:29,170
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

207
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:29,170
out of reach.

208
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:34,650
Immortals

209
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:34,650
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

210
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:38,690
Renegades

211
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:38,690
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

212
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:42,530
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

213
00:17:40,390 --> 00:17:42,530
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

214
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:46,650
because I don't see the harm in that.

215
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:54,450
My new body opens its eyes

216
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:54,450
and awakens from its dream.

217
00:17:54,320 --> 00:18:02,010
I have overcome many trials

218
00:17:56,440 --> 00:18:02,010
to get this body back.

219
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:09,650
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

220
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:09,650
I can still see.

221
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:19,010
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

222
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:19,010
by my own hands.

223
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:40,410
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

224
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:40,410
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

225
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:47,970
With a flick of a finger,

226
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:47,970
only my indomitable heart remains.

227
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:57,370
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

228
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:57,370
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

229
00:18:57,360 --> 00:19:05,210
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

230
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:05,210
like the descent of a god.
